# because lume and lume-core genuinely diverged (agenthttpd
# integration, the native-backend CLI, the ToolDef tag, the seeded
# sql_* builtins).  A bump may still need a hand-merge in them, and
# check-sync reports how far behind upstream each one is.
# The core-specific files (codegen*/backend*/llvm_codegen*/rt.c) are
# not copied at all - lume has no native backend, agent-httpd owns it.
